# NCERT original PDFs. ~1 GB for English Class 1-4 alone and tens of GB once all
# 23 languages are in, so they stay on disk (content/ncert/<Language>/<Book>/) but
# out of git. The extracted .txt files and each book's manifest.json (source URLs +
# SHA-256 of every PDF) ARE committed; re-download the PDFs with
# `python -m app.ingestion.ingest_wave` and verify them against the manifest.
content/ncert/**/*.pdf